  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EdARC will progress a planned program of research, analytical work and professional learning.  It will respond to demand for additional technical assistance, as required, for DFAT education and skills programs. EdARC&apos;s goal is to improve the extent and quality of evidence and expertise used by DFAT to inform and improve its education policy and programs.</narrative>
